WEBVTT

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.820
Why? Why do you have to go?

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:10.250
Haru-kun, I don't want you to go!

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:14.450
Mii-chan, don't cry. 
We'll see each other again, okay?

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.430
I hate this! Don't go, Haru-kun!

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:21.640
Please? Why... Why do you...

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:26.300
When I grow up, I'll come and get you!

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.590
So... So, when I do, let's get married!

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.880
That way we can always 
be together, side by side.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:34.440
Even if I die,
I'll protect you, Mii-chan!

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.400
Ow!

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:17.260
That way we can always be 
together, side by side.

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:19.640
Even if I die, I'll protect you, Mii-chan!

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.080
Or do you not want to...

00:01:27.190 --> 00:01:29.040
I do! I do!

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:31.390
Haru-kun, I'll marry you!

00:01:49.390 --> 00:01:50.620
<i>This place...</i>

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:54.780
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:18.200
Seirei Gensouki

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:18.200
Seirei Gensouki

00:03:28.970 --> 00:03:33.500
<b>The Kingdom of Beltrum, Year 991 of the Holy Era, Early Spring</b>

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.730
<b>Memories of the Previous World</b>

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.730
<b>Memories of the Previous World</b>

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.730
I'm... Rio?

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:39.240
You're wide open!

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.320
Not good enough!

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.030
Haruto!

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.790
Why did you hesitate in a decisive moment?!

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:52.920
No... Am I Amakawa Haruto?

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:00.550
Mii-chan...

00:04:02.840 --> 00:04:05.640
What are these memories?

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.350
I was on the bus...

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.070
Bus? What's a "bus"?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:13.350
Has the fever made me go crazy?

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:14.520
I...

00:04:16.580 --> 00:04:19.540
Huh? Rio, you awake?

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:24.640
Wow, you're still alive? 
I thought you'd be dead by now.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:27.140
You really are a stubborn brat, aren't you?

00:04:27.140 --> 00:04:30.040
Yesterday, you were reeling from a fever.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:34.380
Hey! Leave that thing in 
some corner of the room.

00:04:34.380 --> 00:04:36.750
And make sure you treat it with care.

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:37.400
Will do!

00:04:39.340 --> 00:04:43.220
But, man, ten gold coins 
was a tasty proposition.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:47.290
Ten gold coins for a simple transport job.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.420
Though there's no way that 
cargo's anything decent.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:52.710
That's true.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.520
That food looks good!

00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:58.070
<i>I'm hungry.</i>

00:04:58.070 --> 00:04:59.160
Hey, Rio!

00:04:59.160 --> 00:04:59.860
Yes?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.980
You stink. Go wash yourself.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:04.860
You're making the food taste bad.

00:05:05.260 --> 00:05:06.700
I'm sorry.

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.820
<i>Amakawa Haruto lived in 
a country called "Japan."</i>

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:28.090
<i>He was twenty years old 
and a university student.</i>

00:05:28.090 --> 00:05:32.060
<i>It seems like there was a 
traffic accident, and... he died.</i>

00:05:32.060 --> 00:05:36.600
A traffic accident? What is that?
 I don't understand!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.520
I mean, I do, but...

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.130
<i>Enough of that!</i>

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:42.120
<i>I am Rio!</i>

00:05:42.120 --> 00:05:46.900
<i>I'm living in these filthy slums 
so that I can avenge my mother!</i>

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.230
Mom?

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:51.990
Why is my hair and your hair black?

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:57.750
Well, Rio, it's probably because your 
father and I came from a far-off place.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:01.820
Does everyone who lives in that 
far-off place have black hair?

00:06:01.820 --> 00:06:07.480
Yes. Your father, your grandfather, 
and your grandmother all had black hair.

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:12.570
Really? One day I want to 
meet grandma and grandpa!

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:19.140
Well, when you're bigger, I'll take 
you there. It's a place called Yagumo.

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.650
Really? You promised, okay?

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:23.200
Yes, I promise.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.540
R-Rio...

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:28.640
<i>Mom...</i>

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:35.430
Hey, you there.

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:37.200
He stinks.

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.100
It's probably best not to get too close.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:42.130
It will be bad for your health.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.440
<i>Who are these women?</i>

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:47.210
Hey, are you listening?

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:48.890
I'm listening. Why?

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:52.780
Have you seen a girl with light purple hair?

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.250
She's about the same age as you.

00:06:55.250 --> 00:06:56.970
You'd better be honest with us.

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.260
Don't know.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:07:02.440
Everyone, I don't think he'll 
answer you if you ask that way.

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.180
Celia...

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:07.850
Please, leave this to me, Miss Vanessa.

00:07:07.850 --> 00:07:12.450
I'm sorry we surprised you 
like that. What is your name?

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.080
I'm called Celia.

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:17.080
Rio...

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.040
Rio? That's an unusual name.

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.990
My parents were immigrants.

00:07:21.990 --> 00:07:25.690
I see. That's why your hair is black.

00:07:25.690 --> 00:07:29.170
The thing is, Rio, I was 
hoping to ask a question.

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:32.800
You mean about the girl with light purple hair?

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:34.240
I haven't seen her.

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:35.630
I see...

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:38.420
Beyond this point are the slums, right?

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:39.660
That's right.

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:40.790
Is it big?

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.270
What do you mean?

00:07:43.510 --> 00:07:46.270
We have to go look for her, you see.

00:07:46.710 --> 00:07:48.480
It would be better not to.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:53.450
It's not somewhere a lady dressed in 
clothes as nice as yours should go.

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:55.200
Nice clothes?

00:07:56.550 --> 00:08:01.160
What kind of clothing do the 
women who live in the slums wear?

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.180
What kind?

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:06.920
The same as common people, 
only completely tattered.

00:08:06.920 --> 00:08:08.880
I see.

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:09.880
Celia...

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:13.320
If that's the case, we should 
change our clothes and come back.

00:08:13.320 --> 00:08:16.400
What are you saying? If we 
don't hurry, that girl will...

00:08:16.400 --> 00:08:17.740
That's right!

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:21.210
But we aren't moving as 
part of an official action.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:24.130
If we make a wrong move and
cause a disturbance...

00:08:24.130 --> 00:08:27.060
I'm sure that's not something 
you want, Lady Christina.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:30.780
Th-Then let's hurry back and find clothing.

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:33.660
Celia!

00:08:33.660 --> 00:08:37.240
Just to make sure, can you look for 
a magic response in the vicinity?

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:39.160
Just a moment, please.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:41.650
<i>Area...</i>

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:45.960
Huh?

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:47.510
<i>Search!</i>

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.200
What is this?

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:00.760
Oh, my. You're...

00:09:01.510 --> 00:09:03.270
Has something happened to that child?

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:07.370
It appears that he's overflowing with 
quite a large quantity of magic power.

00:09:07.370 --> 00:09:10.020
He has the potential necessary to use magic.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:13.690
Ah, yes. There are some like 
that even among the orphans.

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:15.950
He has magic power?

00:09:16.310 --> 00:09:20.080
<i>Magic? This strange light is magic?</i>

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.130
And are there any other reactions?

00:09:22.130 --> 00:09:23.450
There aren't.

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:28.370
The only magic reactions the search 
caught were ours and that boy's.

00:09:28.370 --> 00:09:29.240
I see.

00:09:29.870 --> 00:09:32.210
She must be in there after all.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.480
We have no conclusive evidence, but...

00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.480
<i>Can it be...</i>

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:38.060
for now, all we can do is ready a 
change of clothing and go ourselves.

00:09:34.480 --> 00:09:38.060
<i>that those people can't see this light?</i>

00:09:38.060 --> 00:09:39.320
It seems that way.

00:09:40.630 --> 00:09:42.220
Oh! Here.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.350
Payment for the information. 
Please accept it.

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:48.760
Well, then, goodbye.

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:50.400
Thank you!

00:09:56.180 --> 00:09:57.310
<i>Greater silver coins?!</i>

00:09:57.310 --> 00:09:58.290
<i>There are so many!</i>

00:10:21.590 --> 00:10:23.060
I've return—

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:31.890
Dang it.

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:54.960
<i>Wh-Who is this guy?</i>

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:56.210
Haruto!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:10:59.630
We don't have time right now.

00:11:00.170 --> 00:11:03.190
I will teach you about od, and how 
to use your magic power.

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:06.950
Learn it by remembering this feeling.

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:10.440
<i>H-How to use magic?</i>

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:13.140
Sharpen your senses.

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:17.160
There is light coming from 
your body, isn't there?

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:24.560
Use that light to increase your physical 
abilities and make your body stronger.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:27.120
Take that image and...

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:38.520
Enchant Physical Ability!

00:12:02.740 --> 00:12:05.040
You rotten kid...

00:12:05.040 --> 00:12:07.810
Who are you?

00:12:10.850 --> 00:12:12.980
Don't act cocky with me!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:36.830
<i>Wh-What's that?</i>

00:12:41.330 --> 00:12:42.780
<i>I knew it.</i>

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:47.950
I'll untie you right now. Just wait a minute.

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:51.580
P-Please, save me!

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:56.680
Won't you please... take me to the castle?

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:57.920
The castle?

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:04.170
I beg of you. If you speak to 
my father... he will reward you.

00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:05.940
Your father?

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:10.390
H-Hey!

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:20.780
<i>This girl... She's the girl Celia and 
the others were looking for, isn't she?</i>

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.210
You there! Stop!

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:34.450
Lady Christina! Please, wait!

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:38.630
You lied to us, didn't you?!

00:13:38.930 --> 00:13:40.580
Flora! Flora!

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:43.170
Vanessa! See to Flora!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:44.810
Yes, milady!

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.680
What were you plotting, 
kidnapping my younger sister?

00:13:47.680 --> 00:13:48.770
What?

00:13:48.770 --> 00:13:52.030
I-It's not like that! She asked me to—

00:13:52.030 --> 00:13:53.740
You're saying she asked you to?!

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:55.980
Please, calm down, Lady Christina.

00:13:55.980 --> 00:13:59.790
I am calm. But she's...

00:13:59.790 --> 00:14:03.190
Celia, Roanna, look after Lady Flora.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:06.040
She is unconscious, but it 
appears she is unharmed.

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:06.830
Yes, Miss!

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:08.070
Understood.

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.840
Will you tell us what happened, in detail?

00:14:09.840 --> 00:14:12.680
Like I said. That girl asked me to—

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:17.040
You're lying! That girl would 
never ask to be kidnapped!

00:14:17.930 --> 00:14:20.540
Please, listen until the very end.

00:14:20.540 --> 00:14:21.710
Th-That hurts!

00:14:21.710 --> 00:14:23.960
L-Let go, you loathsome thing!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.480
Let go of her hands.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:32.220
And Lady Christina, 
please stop provoking him.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:38.520
It's his fault! I'll have him 
charged with lèse-majesté!

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:42.710
This boy doesn't know that 
you are from the royal family.

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.800
We must hear from him what happened.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.860
Then hurry and restrain him!

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:49.520
That is the state of things, young man.

00:14:50.330 --> 00:14:52.440
You will accompany us to the castle.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.450
I don't want to.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:57.450
I'm sorry, but this isn't 
a request. It's an order.

00:14:57.450 --> 00:15:02.210
All I did was rescue her. 
Just ask her when she wakes.

00:15:02.470 --> 00:15:06.670
It's no good. We'll have you 
tell us what you know yourself.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:11.180
<i>It seems like trying to protest 
here would only be a waste of time.</i>

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:15.170
Just to talk, then.

00:15:15.170 --> 00:15:19.660
Yes. If you are innocent, 
they should release you.

00:15:22.050 --> 00:15:25.300
Sir Alfred! We've found 
a man still breathing.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.020
Restrain him and bring him out!

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.880
He could be an accomplice to the kidnapping.

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.150
Understood, sir.

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:33.070
Don't push! Stand back!

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.080
<i>My, my...</i>

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:40.060
<i>I suppose I have no choice.</i>

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:45.000
H-Hey! What's wrong?

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.520
What's going on?

00:15:47.770 --> 00:15:49.920
H-He's dead.

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:50.840
What?

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:02.460
What is all of this?!

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:05.240
I thought we were just supposed to talk!

00:16:05.240 --> 00:16:09.780
I am the Vice Captain of the Knights 
of the Royal Guard, Charles Arbor.

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:14.240
You will tell me all you know of 
the kidnapping of the second princess.

00:16:14.480 --> 00:16:15.950
You can't be serious!

00:16:16.420 --> 00:16:19.970
I would rather not have to get rough here.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:23.040
If you'll agree to cooperate with our inquiry,

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:27.220
I wouldn't mind immediately 
releasing you from this situation.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:32.260
First, admit to your complicity in 
the kidnapping of the second princess.

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:34.220
I didn't do anything like that!

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:44.560
You assisted in the kidnapping of 
Princess Flora. Isn't that right?

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:49.870
I haven't... done anything.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:52.920
What a fool.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:16:57.910
Princess Flora!

00:16:59.440 --> 00:17:00.690
Vanessa...

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:02.460
Where am I?

00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.870
Your bedroom, Princess Flora.

00:17:06.320 --> 00:17:07.750
Please, have some.

00:17:07.750 --> 00:17:09.380
Thank you.

00:17:14.720 --> 00:17:19.370
May I ask you to explain what's happened?

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:21.390
Your Highness, the thing is...

00:17:23.260 --> 00:17:25.850
Investigation? Why?

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:31.380
There is a need to determine if the content 
of the boy's testimony is true or not.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:34.240
In that case, please summon him here.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:38.990
That would... That would be very difficult.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:40.620
Why?

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:44.350
That boy is no more than a simple orphan.

00:17:44.350 --> 00:17:46.580
I believe it would require the 
consent of His Majesty, the King.

00:17:47.110 --> 00:17:50.430
Then please hurry and make 
the necessary arrangements.

00:17:50.430 --> 00:17:53.340
I cannot allow him to meet 
with any inconvenience!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:55.870
Understood, Your Highness.

00:17:55.870 --> 00:17:57.440
I will go as well.

00:17:57.440 --> 00:17:58.550
Celia...

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:00.230
I'm counting on you.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:00.850
As you will.

00:18:00.850 --> 00:18:01.580
Your Highness.

00:18:04.090 --> 00:18:08.520
You rotten brat! Hurry up and cough 
up what you know about the kidnappers!

00:18:08.770 --> 00:18:13.530
I-I have... nothing more... to say.

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:15.260
You little—

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:20.570
Vice Captain! If you go too far, he'll die!

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.620
Silence!

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.650
We of the Knights of the Royal Guard
 were charged with her escort,

00:18:24.650 --> 00:18:27.120
and we allowed Princess Flora to be abducted!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:31.300
If we don't restore our reputation, 
things won't end well for you, either!

00:18:31.300 --> 00:18:32.370
Still...

00:18:35.030 --> 00:18:37.760
What is going on here?!

00:18:38.870 --> 00:18:41.810
With the authority granted me as 
Vice Captain of the Knights of the Royal Guard,

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.450
I am conducting a lawful interview.

00:18:43.760 --> 00:18:45.450
I believe my men relayed that

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:49.990
the investigation of that boy 
was to be handled courteously.

00:18:51.150 --> 00:18:53.770
Indeed, they did say that.

00:18:53.770 --> 00:18:58.190
None of that matters now! 
Hurry up and let him down!

00:18:58.190 --> 00:18:59.370
No.

00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:03.730
It is highly likely that the brat was 
involved in the kidnapping of Princess Flora.

00:19:03.730 --> 00:19:08.200
That very same Princess Flora says 
that she owes that young man her life.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.450
Wh-What?

00:19:09.450 --> 00:19:11.460
Her Highness has awakened?

00:19:12.190 --> 00:19:15.300
I-I see. Well, that's the 
most important thing.

00:19:16.010 --> 00:19:18.050
You! Let him down!

00:19:18.050 --> 00:19:18.750
Sir!

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.100
Are you all right?

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.080
Don't touch me...

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:31.500
I-I'm so sorry! I'll heal you right away!

00:19:31.500 --> 00:19:32.420
Let's go!

00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:49.790
I-I'm so glad!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:52.460
Are you all right? Does anything hurt?

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:58.230
Oh! I'm sorry! You must be surprised.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:19:59.450
Where am I?

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:01.220
In the royal palace.

00:20:08.380 --> 00:20:10.130
H-How...

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:13.730
I'm so sorry. We made you go 
through something terrible.

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:16.160
Was it you who healed me?

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:17.300
Yes.

00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:21.380
I'm learning magic at the 
Beltrum Royal Academy, too.

00:20:21.980 --> 00:20:23.240
I'm Celia.

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:26.240
Celia Claire. Do you remember me?

00:20:27.000 --> 00:20:27.840
Area...

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:31.370
Payment for the information. 
Please accept it.

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:32.650
Thank you!

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:35.020
From back then...

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:37.250
Thank you very much.

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:41.610
Not at all! We're the ones who 
should be apologizing to you.

00:20:41.610 --> 00:20:44.510
I'm so sorry you had to go through 
all of that because of us.

00:20:45.360 --> 00:20:48.030
It's not like you did anything wrong.

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:52.770
More importantly, what's going
 to happen to me now?

00:20:52.770 --> 00:20:56.560
It seems you are to be granted an 
audience with His Majesty, the King.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:21:01.000
He says he wants to express his 
gratitude to you in person.

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:02.850
An audience?

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:06.570
Then, I apologize for the imposition,

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:09.240
but could you teach me the 
manners needed for an audience?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:14.170
I can't go see the king 
without knowing any protocol.

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:17.210
Of course! It's no trouble at all!

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:23.560
I look forward to working with you, Rio.

00:21:37.140 --> 00:21:41.340
Now, the young man who rescued 
Her Highness, Princess Flora, will enter!

